{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41638","headline":"避世翁 · 陈陶","name":"避世翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海上一蓑笠，终年垂钓丝。\n沧洲有深意，冠尽何由知。\n直钩不营鱼，蜗室无妻儿。\n渴饮寒泉水，饥飡紫术芝。\n鹤发披两肩，高怀如澄陂。\n曾闻仙老言，云是古鸱夷。\n石窦閟雷雨，金潭养蛟螭。\n乘槎上玉津，骑鹿游峨嵋。\n以人爲语默，与世爲雄雌。\n兹焉乃磻溪，豹变应须时。\n自古隐沦客，无非王者师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}